SANDBOX

This folder holds test files, demos, and small experiments for trying
this repository's project out by hand. It is for playing with the
program, separate from automated tests (tests/) and developer helpers
(tools/).


WHAT GOES HERE

  Sample input files, interactive demo scripts, and throwaway configs
  that let someone exercise the program and see how it behaves. Nothing
  here is installed by make install, and make test does not rely on it.


IN THIS REPOSITORY

  A small sample guide in `guide/` for manually exercising tam against a
  known fixture. From the repository root, after `make command`:

    TAM_KNOWLEDGE_DIR=sandbox/guide ./build/tam show --pipe page:welcome.html
    TAM_KNOWLEDGE_DIR=sandbox/guide ./build/tam show --pipe tam:catalog
    TAM_KNOWLEDGE_DIR=sandbox/guide ./build/tam show --pipe --level expert tam:catalog
    TAM_KNOWLEDGE_DIR=sandbox/guide ./build/tam search welcome

  Add pages or index rows here when verifying a fix by hand; keep the
  fixture small and self-contained.
